    Scope:
    - UniFi Gateway (UDM/UXG/USG) and UniFi Network (Switch/AP) syslog
    - CEF-formatted logs (preferred) and common non-CEF formats

    Notes:
    - Decoder names: unifi-cef, unifi-syslog
    - Fields normalized to Wazuh standard when possible: srcip, dstip, srcport, dstport, user, action, outcome, device, interface, reason, url, proto
    - CEF extension keys frequently used by UniFi: src, dst, spt, dpt, dhost, shost, proto, act, outcome, msg, cs1..cs6 (with cs1Label..), rt (event time), deviceExternalId, deviceInboundInterface, deviceOutboundInterface
    - Rule ID range reserved in this file: 100010-100399

